  "description": "Renowned for his dazzling looks and over-the-top acting, Lee Ji-Yoo is the talk of the town—for better or worse. Desperate to shed his embarrassing reputation, he turns to Lee-Do, a sharp-tongued entertainment director, for some much-needed acting lessons. But as the lines between teacher and student blur, one question remains: is this \"lesson\" really about acting?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
